g> One listing covers girl dress, mother dress, boy shirt-and-shorts set, and father shirt-and-shorts set sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Green tropical print:</strong> Cream palm and animal motifs create a bold green look that stands out in photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Dress ease:</strong> Relaxed dresses keep the girls' and moms' side breezy and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Coordinated sets:</strong> Matching shirts and shorts make the boys' and dads' outfits complete without extra styling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready comfort:</strong> Lightweight woven fabric keeps the full family look breathable for warm-weather plans.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels calm, polished, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Animal Print","Beach","Boy Shirt & Shorts Set","Child 12 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Cream","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt & Shorts","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father 4XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt & Shorts Set","Father XL","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","Green","Green Palm Safari","https://detail.1688.com/offer/754664523823.html?","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Matching Family Shorts Set","Mommy and Me","Mother 2XL","Mother 3XL","Mother 4XL","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother S","Mother XL","Multicolor","Palm Print","Resort","Safari","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Shorts Set","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","V-Neck Dress","Vacation"],"seo":{"title":"Green Palm Safari Matching Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Green tropical family matching set with dresses plus shirt-and-shorts outfits for mom, dad, girls & boys. Sizes 2Y-12Y, Mother S-4XL, Father S-4XL."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > O